# azd/Foundry packaging ignore, mirroring Microsoft's own sample
# (Azure-Samples/microsoft-foundry-hosted-agents). Keep narrow and aligned
# with .dockerignore — this controls what azd considers part of the agent
# package, not what the Dockerfile COPYs.
.azure/
.git/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
